{"4377330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Streamer vs. Chat", "steam_appid": 4377330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Note:<i> </i></strong><i>This game requires an active Twitch connection to function. If Twitch services are unavailable, the game may not work.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An interactive game with Twitch integration where every message matters.</strong><br>In <i>Streamer vs. Chat</i>, the streamer steps into the arena while their Twitch chat becomes part of the game itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers don’t just watch — they <strong>play</strong>, they fight against the streamer, and influence the match in real time using chat commands. From direct combat to chaotic interventions like flashbangs, slowdowns, or mouse sensitivity changes, and more, the chat controls the flow of the game while the streamer tries to survive the madness live on stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>fast-paced arena combat</strong> with weapons, alongside a variety of <strong>interactive mini-games</strong> such as <i>Marbles</i> and <i>Quiz</i>, where the streamer once again competes directly against the chat. Every action matters, every message counts, and no match ever plays out the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your performance through <strong>leaderboards and detailed statistics</strong>, including kills, deaths, points, and more. Whether you’re aiming to dominate your chat or watching them take control, <i><strong>Streamer vs. Chat</strong></i> turns your livestream into a competitive, chaotic, and unforgettable experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Real-time Twitch integration</strong><br>Whatever happens in chat happens in the game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/e07cbe6494c69275f7be38e830b5c408.poster.avif?t=1788140124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/e07cbe6494c69275f7be38e830b5c408.webm?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/e07cbe6494c69275f7be38e830b5c408.mp4?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Streamer vs. Chat gameplay</strong><br>Fight your own viewers in fast-paced arena combat.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/ac1605af240c730dd25f2bec315b5c7b.poster.avif?t=1788140124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/ac1605af240c730dd25f2bec315b5c7b.webm?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/ac1605af240c730dd25f2bec315b5c7b.mp4?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧑 <strong>Chat-controlled characters</strong><br>Viewers spawn as in-game <strong>Peepo</strong> characters with their Twitch usernames.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/0e34f414be6494cb60f32ce0e4783bc8.poster.avif?t=1788140124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/0e34f414be6494cb60f32ce0e4783bc8.webm?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/0e34f414be6494cb60f32ce0e4783bc8.mp4?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong>Chaos commands</strong><br>Flashbangs, slowdown, screen effects, mouse sensitivity changes, and more — controlled by chat.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/aab54b790bcf9cefb15eeff7ccfea0d7.poster.avif?t=1788140124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/aab54b790bcf9cefb15eeff7ccfea0d7.webm?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/aab54b790bcf9cefb15eeff7ccfea0d7.mp4?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Interactive mini-games</strong><br>Play Marbles, Quiz, and other modes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/f9d0c20c9ac30cbc975f6e0d931be52f.poster.avif?t=1788140124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/f9d0c20c9ac30cbc975f6e0d931be52f.webm?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/f9d0c20c9ac30cbc975f6e0d931be52f.mp4?t=1788140124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Leaderboards &amp; stats</strong><br>Track kills, deaths, points, damage, messages sent, and time alive.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377330/extras/1df554722ffa2477dbd